<p>Requires Disk 1 and Disk 2 of the original game alternatively inserted alternately into DF0. The save disk is in DF1.</p>
<h2>Controls</h2>
<div class="key"><span class="label">Right mouse button</span><span class="state">exit some screens and popups.</span></div>
<h2>Hacks</h2>
<div class="key"><span class="label">Space bar</span><span class="state">advance time.</span></div>
